<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM4.7.6">
<l>talaippeytu kumuṟic calampoti mēkañ calacala poḻintiṭak kaṇṭu</l>
<l>malaipperuṅ kuṭaiyāl maṟaittavaṉ maturai mālpuru ṭōttamaṉ vāḻ</l>
<l>valaippuṭait tiraivā yaruntava muṉiva ravapira taṅkuṭain tāṭa</l>
<l>kalappaikaḷ koḻikkuṅ kaṅkaiyiṉ karaimēl kaṇṭameṉ ṉuṅkaṭi nakarē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>The dwelling place of Māl Puruṣottama,</l>
<l rend="indent">who, seeing the cloud filled with water,</l>
<l>as a torrential downpour [began] overhead,</l>
<l rend="indent">resounding with the sound of pattering [rain],</l>
<l>protected Madurai with a huge umbrella [made of a] mountain,</l>
<l>is the protected city called Kaṇṭam</l>
<l rend="indent">on the banks of the Ganges where ploughs are cast ashore</l>
<l>as sages practice difficult austerities</l>
<l rend="indent">[and] plunge into the waves that ebb and flow</l>
<l>for [their] ritual ablutions.</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
